# HP48gII compact Stock Font Gallery through stock Kermit + ARMToolbox48.
# The install/launch path deliberately mirrors hp48gii-stock-run.seq; only the
# post-launch Gallery captures differ from the canonical runtime sequence.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
# Factory default is ALG; use RPN for the stack-based library install.
5000 tap mode
5500 tap neg
6000 tap f6
7000 capture home-rpn
# Configure wire I/O to Serial.
8000 tap files
9500 tap down
10000 tap enter
11500 tap down
12000 tap down
12500 tap down
13000 tap down
14000 tap enter
16000 tap up
17000 tap f2
18000 tap down
18500 tap enter
20000 tap enter
# Start stock Kermit server.
22000 tap files
23500 tap down
24500 tap enter
26000 tap down
27000 tap down
28000 tap down
29000 tap down
30000 tap down
31500 tap enter
33500 capture server-serial
# Host begins Kermit at t=35s and may use the full 110s transfer budget.
150000 capture after-transfer
# Install ARMToolbox48 Library 275 into Port 0. HPCLANG is F1 and L275 is F2.
151000 tap var
152000 capture vars-before-install
153000 tap f2
154000 capture l275-stack
155000 tap zero
156000 tap enter
157000 capture port-zero-stack
158000 tap sto
160000 capture stored
162000 chord on f3
168000 capture after-warmstart
169000 tap var
170000 capture vars-after-install
171000 tap f1
173000 capture hpclang-stack
# Library 275 is the first LIB entry; ARMTo exposes PrRUN on F1.
175000 chord rshift two
176500 capture lib-menu
177500 tap f1
179000 capture armtoolbox
179500 monitor 60000
180000 tap f1
# Compact Gallery starts on Native / calculator minifont. DOWN changes face
# within the Native family; RIGHT then advances to the generated-control family.
188000 capture native-mini
190000 tap down
192000 capture native-main
194000 tap right
196000 capture generated-control
198000 tap on
